From: Silas Mikkelsen <noreply@example.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:27:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add export-png and goto-page editor commands; try .tex in -I
 paths; find TeX Live pictures with kpsewhich

---
